Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眉头皱得这么紧 可惜了这么可爱的脸蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 笑一个 好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.30,0:01:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯恩大人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你…你干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那果然只是不小心碰到的意外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.91,0:02:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意外？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.63,0:02:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使被嘲笑 也在努力着
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我这么喜欢大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:17.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不会有任何改变
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.38,0:02:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.67,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了 我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.85,0:02:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜欢大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.37,0:02:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险男子 MAITY的甜蜜诱惑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米饭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感冒那天小泉在我家的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是像这样 小泉的脸就在我眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉的头发这边 粘着一颗亮晶晶的米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粘着一颗米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粘着一颗米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米饭…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.65,0:03:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.26,0:03:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早饭我要吃面包
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身为日本人 早饭就应该吃米饭和味噌汤
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话不是你说的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.73,0:03:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要吃米饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:26.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就一边想要糗你 一边要把米拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.39,0:03:28.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结果脑袋就一阵眩晕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的初吻 居然只是个意外
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:34.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是为了要亲吻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了要帮我拿掉头发上粘的米粒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不小心碰到我的嘴唇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.66,0:03:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为上次姐姐玩的游戏里的什么大人喜欢面包吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:03.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯恩大人的早餐一定是可颂面包加咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今天起 我也要配合他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:08.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然等结了婚 可就伤脑筋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐真的是有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 快回来 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.48,0:04:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到现实世界来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.78,0:04:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,17岁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高172
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个尺寸偏大的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我现在有个非常喜欢的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.67,0:04:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和肯恩大人长得一模一样的MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:51.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天还是一样的迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:54.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 你看起来很精神呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？我一直都很精神的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.53,0:04:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你昨天哭了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.84,0:05:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从走廊跑过的时候 我刚好也在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.53,0:05:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意的话 可以找我商量
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:10.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不开心的话 随时可以过来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,心动
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.33,0:05:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我非常喜欢MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 我有点话想和你说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶 奇怪 好像有人在说话 是错觉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是躲在哪里小角落里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.03,0:05:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那种无谓的事情比起来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.66,0:05:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师 今天也很期待你的讲课
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.90,0:05:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强吻别人 居然还无视别人的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲吻？强吻？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:52.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.55,0:05:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你！胡说什么呢 在MAITY老师面前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 你干完就想跑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:05:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛 你在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦 只是要你闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是搞笑二人组 感情真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.14,0:06:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是在交往吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才没有在交往 感情也不好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不是搞笑二人组
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.34,0:06:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 要上课了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 已经够了 像个笨蛋一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.17,0:06:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜欢这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.89,0:06:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算想起他都是在浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.56,0:06:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶？放弃了？ 是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思 为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉你们 青春是很短暂的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟在他屁股后面追要追到什么时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.83,0:06:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很快我就会变成老太婆了 真是傻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 又开始胡思乱想了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:56.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 求求你快恢复过来 理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 又发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.90,0:07:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么 我只是受够了大谷的愚蠢而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的 你先等下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.45,0:07:10.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 理莎 都已经努力到这份上了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.88,0:07:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了 再也不理他了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从今天起 我要向新的恋情迈出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的恋情？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.05,0:07:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一步？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师几岁了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.61,0:07:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.94,0:07:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,23岁差不多？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就算是好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:36.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差那么一点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了 那让人鸡皮疙瘩一地的氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是24?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她什么时候跑去的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说新的恋情是跟MAITY老师？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 不行不行不行 妈妈坚决反对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.89,0:08:08.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为 我已经尽了最大的努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.35,0:08:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再怎么努力 也不会有任何改变
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 在装忧郁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.74,0:08:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不用装都忧郁
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:24.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.13,0:08:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被小泉强吻了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.88,0:08:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你真是常被人强吻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次是被圣子强吻的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:41.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 我到底在发什么呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会发生那样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.85,0:08:52.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 具体我也不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.56,0:08:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是什么时候 我有亲过小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不太清楚？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天我感冒发烧 根本不记得
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.84,0:09:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 无意识偷袭？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的这么没有魅力吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格说起来 应该是我被侵犯的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.05,0:09:25.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定是非常喜欢大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.49,0:09:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.67,0:09:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是非常喜欢大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 这我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 原来你知道啊 吓了我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.24,0:09:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你自己说的啊 你在发呆
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没呆到那种程度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 她说她放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:10:00.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放弃 放弃 说ByeBye
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好 感谢大家的出席
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:11.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是MAITY部的部长 小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.53,0:10:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天为了纪念MAITY部的成立
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:19.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们特地邀请到MAITY老师本人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 大家一起叫MAITY老师的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.20,0:10:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1 2 3
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:27.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.09,0:10:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来来来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.09,0:10:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有问题想问MAITY老师的 请举手！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.55,0:10:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师 你有正在交往的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.40,0:10:45.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.70,0:10:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师 为什么♂∴♀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:53.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师难道是∷§∞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.41,0:11:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀 这声音
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 小泉在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.61,0:11:12.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社团活动？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.74,0:11:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对的 MAITY部
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:16.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY部 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.87,0:11:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以研究MAITY老师的生活情况为主的社团
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.69,0:11:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊什么啊 你这个该死的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.67,0:11:26.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信被理莎附身了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在生什么气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都听亲爱的说了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是大谷的错 快想办法阻止那个什么MAITY部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么是我的错啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你只知道发呆 连亲没亲都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情才会变这么棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.43,0:11:56.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要大谷小小道个歉 理莎就会消气的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:58.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道什么歉啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,道什么歉都好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后叫她不要再搞那个冷到爆的社团 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 怎么没去社团活动
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顾问闪到腰 要休息一阵
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.63,0:12:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY命？ 你还是别搞那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.23,0:12:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是别人的自由 要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.82,0:12:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 跟他单独相处 会想起那件事的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说是一时冲动 可我怎么能干出那种事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 别说了 别提那件事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感冒那天 真的亲了小泉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 我不是叫你别说了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.35,0:13:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起？这是为什么道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.73,0:13:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是为了你不记得亲我这件事道歉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是 你无论如何没法把我当女生看待 而道歉？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.96,0:13:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不用做出这么明显的困扰表情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 不用再想了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.61,0:14:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说了吗 我放弃了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.40,0:14:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久以来给你添了很多麻烦 真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于我的事 就不用你操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:26.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走 别说你要放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.17,0:14:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有点期待 希望他会这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.57,0:14:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能的 他怎么会那么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:37.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备回去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.57,0:14:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊… 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉真的很努力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是真的很喜欢大谷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.16,0:15:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我这么喜欢大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:25.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是不会有任何改变
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:31.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不要喜欢大谷了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是算了 够了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.45,0:16:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:19.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.05,0:16:24.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,声音太小了 再来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.87,0:16:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,M A I T Y Love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经没有自信继续跟理莎做朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是MAITY部的社团活动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.76,0:16:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.15,0:16:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以MAITY老师从今天起担任篮球部的顾问
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.22,0:16:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是顾问腰伤痊愈之前的临时任命 忍忍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么偏偏让他当临时教练啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 大谷你想想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.67,0:16:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再这样下去 理莎真的会迷上那个恶心吧啦的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.99,0:16:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那关我什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫不关你的事 明明就是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.93,0:17:04.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么又是我的错 明明是她自己要移情别恋的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.34,0:17:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下… 不要攻击我可爱的小信
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被攻击的明明是我好不好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.90,0:17:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉同学
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:20.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你精神恢复了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:24.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好不要太勉强自己哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 也不是什么大不了的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.99,0:17:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们会去篮球部为MAITY老师加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.93,0:17:38.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 那就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:45.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY my love MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油哦 好帅哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.70,0:17:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会打篮球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.51,0:17:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛 你说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.79,0:17:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太卑鄙了 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.79,0:18:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.28,0:18:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAI…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAI…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.01,0:18:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 搞什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.29,0:18:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 部长 我们要给MAITY老师加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.35,0:18:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我高中一直都打篮球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 让人怎么打球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 真让人生气
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.00,0:19:00.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 我们的练习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.85,0:19:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.49,0:19:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说 你这样真的好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.14,0:19:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以后的青春 全都要献给MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:23.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.50,0:19:25.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不要你跟那种人在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:27.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我也没办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经努力到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.26,0:19:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可就算说放弃的时候 他也不阻止我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原来你们在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 社团活动结束了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:40.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在闹别扭 不知道跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:46.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他一直都被MAITY老师抢走球
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.91,0:19:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定是沮丧地躲起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你去找他 安慰一下他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛要我去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.33,0:19:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定这以后他就不打篮球了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那怎么可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:09.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.00,0:20:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有件事想问你 方便吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.19,0:20:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前几天弄哭小泉的 是不是你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.65,0:20:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在的表情很可怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你烦不烦啊 恶心死了 是又怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子很容易受伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以一定要更温柔地对待她们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:36.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这跟你无关 不要你管
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.50,0:20:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 大概是喜欢你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.87,0:20:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 不知道你对小泉感觉如何
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.88,0:20:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那跟你无关
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.37,0:20:54.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我就要抢走她喽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.65,0:21:01.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了随便你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我对小泉什么感觉都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:29.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚那句话 我没听错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.23,0:21:36.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被同一个人 甩了两次？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.11,0:23:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.68,0:23:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY MAITY的叫 吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.51,0:23:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再参加那个恶心吧啦的MAITY部了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.11,0:23:12.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你嫉妒了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.05,0:23:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恋爱情结 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:17.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,MAITY的魔法！变化的恋爱模样！？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:23:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
